, attempts current-term commitment and broadcasts advance…\",\n      \"ref_ids\": [\n        \"S-caller\",\n        \"S-async\",\n        \"S-durable\",\n        \"S-application\",\n        \"S-timeout\",\n        \"S-authority\",\n        \"S-dispatch\",\n        \"S-proposal\",\n        \"S-replication\",\n        \"S-transfer\",\n        \"S-config\",\n        \"S-abort\",\n        \"S-advance\",\n        \"S-ready\",\n        \"S-auto-contract\",\n        \"S-joint\"\n      ],\n      \"record\": {\n        \"path\": \"state.json\",\n        \"collection\": \"selections\",\n        \"match\": {\n          \"operation_id\": \"185cf70358d349f98fd4282c66ad4a7b\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"feedback\": {\n        \"ref_ids\": [\n          \"S-caller\",\n          \"S-async\",\n          \"S-durable\",\n          \"S-application\",\n          \"S-timeout\",\n          \"S-authority\",\n          \"S-dispatch\",\n          \"S-proposal\",\n          \"S-replication\",\n          \"S-transfer\",\n          \"S-config\",\n          \"S-abort\",\n          \"S-advance\",\n          \"S-ready\",\n          \"S-auto-contract\",\n          \"S-joint\"\n        ],\n        \"answered\": \"A1 learning: leader proposals append term/index-tagged entries; self acknowledgments and follower append/vote responses wait for persistence. Leader response handling updates Progress, attempts current-term commitment and broadcasts advancement. JointConfig requires both constituent majorities. A2 learning: higher-term messages ordinarily trigger follower transition with explicit pre-vote and lease exceptions; old-term replies are ignored, while old storage snapshot completions retain meaning as committed state. reset clears votes, replication progress and read-only tracking but retains the log. becomeLeader appends an empty entry and conservatively defers configuration proposals behind the inherited tail. Applied configuration changes the voter tracker used by formation and election. Application completion differs from durability: MsgStorageApplyResp is term-independent; ordinary RawNode.Advance dispatches precomputed completions, and heartbeat-only Ready batches do not create application acknowledgments. Early surface: AutoLeave promises implementation-owned transition when possible. appliedTo attempts an empty configuration proposal, but stepLeader rejects proposals during leadership transfer. The retry comment refers to the next advance after failed transfer, whereas tickHeartbeat timeout calls abortLeaderTransfer, whose body only clears leadTransferee. This discrepancy is an unresolved retry premise, not a demonstrated violation.\",\n        \"remaining\": [\n          \"Complete initial core overview through campaign aggregation, follower append matching, snapshot restore, persistence reconstruction and configuration changer validation. This partial learning does not establish map readiness.\",\n          \"Investigate whether a legal Ready/application schedule can place the only automatic exit attempt during transfer, followed by transfer timeout without further unapplied entries. Read caller duties, existing tests and alternative retry triggers before execution.\",\n          \"Independent surface: switchToConfig can advance commitment and broadcast without the pending-read release call present in MsgAppResp handling. Determine whether pending reads can legally exist then and whether another consumer necessarily releases them.\"\n        ],\n        \"understanding\": \"updated\",\n        \"rationale\": \"Preserve producer/consumer distinctions. Durability ordering and term filtering counter an immediate stale-ack safety allegation. Automatic exit can succeed on ordinary application completion or a new leader applying its empty entry; these protections do not yet answer the failed-transfer/no-new-application premise.\",\n        \"question_updates\": {}\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"pending_work\": [],\n  \"current\": {\n    \"phase\": \"execut